    "preferred": "Acer truncatum x 'JFS-KW202 ' Crimson Sunset® Shantung Maple Zones 5-9 The Crimson Sunset® Maple, also known as Acer truncatum 'JFS-KW202' is a remarkable hybrid of Norway maple and Shantung maple. It showcases the vibrant purple foliage of Crimson King while offering a more upright and compact growth habit. This maple typically grows at a moderate rate, reaching about 15-20 ft in height and 10-15 ft in width within 10 years."
